Urban Cowboy is a 1980 American romantic Western film directed by James Bridges.

13
01:35:20,000 --> 01:35:26,000
The plot concerns the love-hate relationship between Buford "Bud"
Davis (John Travolta) and Sissy (Debra Winger).

14
